 ('Write a 6-line radio exchange using standard phrases.','Pilot: Tower, Delta-Four-Two, request taxi. Tower: Delta-Four-Two, taxi to holding point runway zero-nine. Pilot: Taxi to holding point zero-nine, Delta-Four-Two. Tower: Readback correct. Pilot: Wilco. Tower: Roger.',['Fraseologia correta','Números dígito a dígito'],'6 linhas'),
