 ('Write a 6-sentence news paragraph about a (fictional) data breach, neutral in tone.','A retail chain said on Monday that a database containing customer emails had been accessed without authorisation. The company said no payment details were affected. Analysts traced the breach to a weak password on an old server. Officials have notified the data protection regulator. Customers are advised to change their passwords. The company said an investigation was under way.',['Passiva e atribuição','Tom neutro'],'6 frases'),
